msgid ""
"Create beautiful,<br/><span class=\"platform-line\">accessible<br/><span "
"class=\"platform web\">web</span></span><br/>apps."
msgstr ""

#: index.md:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One resolved token model, reshaped into stylesheets, framework bindings, "
"native code, and design-tool payloads."
msgstr ""
"Yon sèl modèl tòken rezoud, refòme an fichye stil, lyen pou kad (framework), "
"kòd natif, ak chaj pou zouti konsepsyon."

#: index.md:10
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Kòmanse"

#: index.md:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "CSS reference"
msgstr "Referans CSS"

#: index.md:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Referans API"

#: index.md:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "One source of truth"
msgstr "Yon sèl sous laverite"

#: index.md:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every packages uses the official Instructure design tokens, components, and "
"interactions from <a href=\"https://instructure.design\" "
"target=\"_blank\">InstUI</a>."
msgstr ""

#: index.md:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Sèvi ak pi piti pakè a"

#: index.md:28
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install just <code>@pantoken/css</code> for a stylesheet, <code>@pantoken/"
"pendo</code> for guides, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr ""
"Enstale sèlman @pantoken/css pou yon fichye stil, @pantoken/react pou hooks "
"ak ikon, oswa yon preset bundler pou Tailwind, Panda, oswa MUI."

#: index.md:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Jenere pou nenpòt platfòm"

#: index.md:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install the pantoken cli to generate presets or add components for any "
"platform&colon; web, native, and anything in between."
msgstr ""

#: index.md:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "No React needed"
msgstr ""

#: index.md:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The InstUI library is tightly coupled with React. If you want to use it, you "
"have to use React. Now you can build anywhere."
msgstr ""

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
#~ msgstr "InstUI, toupatou"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream "
#~ "and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Chak pakè li menm IR tòken rezoud la. Chanje yon tòken anwo, epi li pral "
#~ "rive nan CSS, SCSS, kòd natif, ak Figma menm jan an."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, "
#~ "WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Egzekite `pantoken generate` pou pwodui Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, "
#~ "Rust, WordPress, ak plis ankò. Menm tòken yo, nan idyòm chak ekosistèm."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "No upstream coupling"
#~ msgstr "Pa gen kouplaj ak sous anlè"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a "
#~ "GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Tòken yo anbake kòm JSON estatik, kidonk `npm i` pa janm depann sou yon "
#~ "sous ki sèlman sou GitHub. Piblikab, semver, epi zanmitay offline."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "The package map"
#~ msgstr "Kat pakè a"
